{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This is the same content as the <strong>free iOS/Android version</strong> of <strong>Ave Classic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PC version will be available as a <strong>paid fan disc edition</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/46c3903ce70bdd4dff58b453725ba33b.poster.avif?t=1770131034\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/46c3903ce70bdd4dff58b453725ba33b.webm?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/46c3903ce70bdd4dff58b453725ba33b.mp4?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work with Personified Classical Music Characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1\u25a0 Features \u25a1\u25a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomodoro Timer\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000The Pomodoro Technique alternates focus and break periods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000It helps maintain concentration with time management based on how the brain works.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/97bce8d1bc53c2b3192b3e938a7bab48.poster.avif?t=1770131034\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/97bce8d1bc53c2b3192b3e938a7bab48.webm?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/97bce8d1bc53c2b3192b3e938a7bab48.mp4?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To-Do List\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000A simple feature to visualize and organize your tasks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/af88481c3d02fb6549f995be26884d5b.poster.avif?t=1770131034\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/af88481c3d02fb6549f995be26884d5b.webm?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/af88481c3d02fb6549f995be26884d5b.mp4?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Music for Work:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Includes a selection of classical music to enhance your focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000You can play relaxing classical tracks for calm working sessions or upbeat pieces to boost your motivation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/a18e09675252596ad563952932737c33.poster.avif?t=1770131034\" width=550 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/a18e09675252596ad563952932737c33.webm?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/a18e09675252596ad563952932737c33.mp4?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a1\u25a0 Rewards \u25a1\u25a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Earn points based on how much you focus on your work!<br>\u3000\u3000You can use these points to unlock new character outfits and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a1\u25a0 Main Story Summary \u25a1\u25a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cThe Muse of Music is dead.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you find yourself lost in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a garden-like realm governed by the god of music, <strong>The Muse</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, music takes physical form, and it\u2019s here that you encounter <strong>classic music boys</strong>, human incarnations of classical compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the death of The Muse, the world faces the threat of music disappearing forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You possess the power of a <strong>Conductor</strong>, one who can control music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect this world, you must guide the classic music boys and unravel the mystery behind The Muse\u2019s death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of you, a human, and them, the embodiment of music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519760?t=1770131034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519760?t=1770131034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/e54871fd399a6fd62e780c31c97a184f8e0ccaf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770131034","capsule_imagev5":"