m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/a18e09675252596ad563952932737c33.webm?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519760/extras/a18e09675252596ad563952932737c33.mp4?t=1770131034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a1\u25a0 Rewards \u25a1\u25a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Earn points based on how much you focus on your work!<br>\u3000\u3000You can use these points to unlock new character outfits and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a1\u25a0 Main Story Summary \u25a1\u25a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cThe Muse of Music is dead.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you find yourself lost in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a garden-like realm governed by the god of music, <strong>The Muse</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, music takes physical form, and it\u2019s here that you encounter <strong>classic music boys</strong>, human incarnations of classical compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the death of The Muse, the world faces the threat of music disappearing forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You possess the power of a <strong>Conductor</strong>, one who can control music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect this world, you must guide the classic music boys and unravel the mystery behind The Muse\u2019s death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of you, a human, and them, the embodiment of music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AAAA Dogs"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id